msgstr "Tema"

#: setup.php
msgid "Please select one of the available Themes to skin your Cacti Graph Exports with."
msgstr "Kies asseblief een van die beskikbare Temas om jou Cacti-grafiekuitvoere mee te stileer."

#: setup.php
msgid "Presentation Method"
msgstr "Aanbiedingsmetode"

#: setup.php
msgid "Choose which presentation would you want for the html generated pages. If you choose classical presentation; the Graphs will be in a only-one-html page. If you choose tree presentation, the Graph Tree architecture will be kept in the static html pages"
msgstr "Kies watter aanbieding jy vir die HTML-gegenereerde bladsye wil hê. As jy klassieke aanbieding kies, sal die Grafieke in 'n enkele HTML-bladsy wees. As jy boomaanbieding kies, sal die Grafiekboom-argitektuur in die statiese HTML-bladsye behou word"

#: setup.php
